LocalThings (Home Assistant integration)
https://github.com/mbillow/localthings

The appliance resource model in lib/registry/ and lib/resources.py is ported from
this project: which OCF resource each capability reads and writes, the vendor
resource paths, the board-token and consumer-model identification tables, and the
enumerated mode values. The wire-protocol constants documented in docs/PORTING.md
were also established there.

